{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOD9Inxg","is_bot":false,"login":"Peter7896","name":"Bubu"},"body":"**Bounty:** $40 (LT)\n\n**Area:** `build.py`, `diagnostic/`, `tests/`\n\n**Current state:** `build.py` generates diagnostic metadata and encrypted `.logd` artifacts, but there is no focused regression coverage that protects the redaction and path-normalization contract across Windows and Unix-like hosts.\n\n**What's needed:** Add deterministic tests or helpers that validate diagnostic redaction, artifact pairing, and repository-relative path reporting without relying on live services.\n\n**Acceptance criteria:**\n- Validate that diagnostic metadata reports artifact paths as repository-relative `/` paths.\n- Assert local home, repo, temp paths, machine names, and usernames are not leaked in diagnostic metadata.\n- Confirm the `.logd` reference in JSON matches a generated encrypted artifact in `diagnostic/`.\n- Fail clearly when the JSON is missing, the `.logd` artifact is missing, or the pair is mismatched.\n- Keep the coverage deterministic on Windows and Unix-like hosts.\n\n**Required validation:**\n- Run `python3 build.py`\n- Include the generated diagnostic `.logd` artifact from `diagnostic/build-XXX.logd`; also include `diagnostic/build-XXX.json` if present\n- Use `.github/pull_request_template.md` for your submission\n\n**Tracker note:** This issue is opened for the upstream LT bounty tracker; bounty eligibility and payout are determined by upstream review, merge, and tracker rules.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG0ifNA","author":{"login":"Buyurgutdev"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #1\n\nPlan: add deterministic Python regression coverage for diagnostic redaction and artifact pairing. I will inspect `build.py` and existing diagnostic output, add helper/test coverage that verifies repository-relative `/` paths, checks that local home/repo/temp/user/machine identifiers do not leak into diagnostic metadata, validates JSON-to-`.logd` pairing, run the focused tests and `python3 build.py`, and submit a scoped PR with the required diagnostic artifacts.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T15:08:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4752711476","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG0mckg","author":{"login":"fengyangxxx"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/attempt #1","createdAt":"2026-06-19T15:17:08Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4752776338","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG0tXhw","author":{"login":"BERT70293"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"submitted PR #4 — 15 tests covering path reporting, PII redaction, artifact pairing, error handling, and cross-platform consistency. all passing.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T15:35:05Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4752889735","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG025Hw","author":{"login":"Peter7896"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Thanks for the submissions. For this issue, the reviewable unit should stay focused on diagnostic redaction/regression coverage only.\n\nI see PRs that mention this issue. A PR that bundles this with the protocol codec issue is not ready to forward as-is, because the upstream tracker needs one clearly scoped change per bounty. A bounty-ready PR also needs the exact script-generated diagnostic artifacts from `python3 build.py`: a matching `diagnostic/build-*.json` and `diagnostic/build-*.logd` pair in the changed files.\n\nI will review the single-purpose diagnostic-redaction PR first. Please keep any follow-up PR scoped to this issue and avoid hand-editing diagnostic output.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T15:50:16Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4753045791","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG1XdDA","author":{"login":"bilalabsh"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #7 for this issue.\n\nAdds regression tests around diagnostic metadata in build.py — repo-relative path reporting, PII redaction (home/repo/temp paths, username, hostname), JSON ↔ .logd artifact pairing, and clear failures when metadata or artifacts are missing or mismatched. Also includes helpers in build.py to enforce the redaction and path-normalization contract without relying on live services.\n\n14 tests, all passing locally:\n\npython3 -m unittest tests.test_diagnostic_redaction -v\nAlso ran python3 build.py and committed the diagnostic bundle (diagnostic/build-6b3111c3.logd + matching .json) for review.\n\nReady for upstream review when you have a chance.\n\n","createdAt":"2026-06-19T17:24:49Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4753579276","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG1dVYA","author":{"login":"thanhle74"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming this bounty for the diagnostic redaction regression tests.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T17:43:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4753675616","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG1eKxg","author":{"login":"Ojas2095"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"/claim\n\nI'd like to take this on! Reviewing the repository right now and will submit a PR shortly.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T17:45:27Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4753689286","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG1rrAw","author":{"login":"Nexussyn"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Submission — Runtime Open Federation\n\n**Payment address (USDC on Base):** `0xb438d36b425b504724a1c72aa0941c80cb940995`\nWe can complete this task and deliver within 24h. Please assign to confirm.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T18:30:21Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4753910531","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG2B68A","author":{"login":"Daisuke134"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Submitted PR #13 with regression tests for diagnostic redaction and path normalization. 16/17 tests pass (1 skip: single-artifact case).\n\nValidation:\n```\n$ python3 -m pytest tests/test_diagnostic_redaction.py -v\n... 16 passed, 1 skipped in 0.02s\n```\n\nDiagnostic artifacts committed in the PR.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T19:41:39Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4754275056","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG3nCKw","author":{"login":"zjwjing"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I would like to work on adding diagnostic redaction regression tests.\n\nPlan:\n1. Analyze build.py and diagnostic/ structure\n2. Create tests for:\n   - Artifact paths as repository-relative paths\n   - No leakage of local paths, machine names, usernames\n   - .logd reference matching\n   - Missing file handling\n3. Ensure cross-platform compatibility (Windows/Unix)\n4. Run python3 build.py and include diagnostic artifacts\n\nWallet: 0x8971bC40f06e90015C5e92d247c96BfB65C24Cc7","createdAt":"2026-06-20T01:37:37Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4755931691","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABG9wC1A","author":{"login":"xudexing19920829"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I would like to claim this bounty ($50).\n\n**My experience:**\n- Rust programming\n- Protocol implementation\n- Recovery testing\n\n**My plan:**\n1. Fork and study existing code\n2. Add protocol frame codec recovery tests\n3. Cover error recovery scenarios\n4. Submit PR\n\nI can start immediately.","createdAt":"2026-06-21T15:03:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4762370772","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS88ncc8AAAABI3P7EA","author":{"login":"yanyishuai"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Claiming #1 — diagnostic redaction regression tests with sanitized metadata paths. /claim #1","createdAt":"2026-07-06T06:33:01Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1#issuecomment-4889770768","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"createdAt":"2026-06-19T15:03:36Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDOS88ncc8AAAACnvm4Rw","name":"help wanted","description":"Extra attention is needed","color":"008672"},{"id":"LA_kwDOS88ncc8AAAACnvm4SQ","name":"good first issue","description":"Good for newcomers","color":"7057ff"},{"id":"LA_kwDOS88ncc8AAAACoGrb5w","name":"language:python","description":"Python work item","color":"3572A5"},{"id":"LA_kwDOS88ncc8AAAACoGroVA","name":"bounty","description":"Bounty-tracked work item","color":"FBCA04"}],"state":"OPEN","title":"[$40 BOUNTY] [Python] Add diagnostic redaction regression tests","updatedAt":"2026-07-06T06:33:01Z","url":"https://github.com/Peter7896/TentOfTrials/issues/1"}
